@ref 2026, c. 11, s. 57 (src:19388-19389)
GIVEN `the fine is unpaid on the day on which sections 41 and 42 of 2026, c. 11 come into force` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`2026 c 11 s 57 the provisions of the Criminal Code enacted by sections 41 and 42 apply to the proceeds of the fine` MEANS
    IF `the fine is unpaid on the day on which sections 41 and 42 of 2026, c. 11 come into force`
