    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the proceeds of a fine that is unpaid on the day on which those sections come into force"

-- 58 (1) the provisions enacted by sections 8, 9, 11, 37, 40 and 43 apply only with respect to an offence committed on or after the day those sections come into force.
-- 2026 c 11 s 58(1): "apply only" -- on or after the day (strictly after, where the text says "after") is within the limit (JUST TRUE); before it, the text says no (JUST FALSE).
