@ref 2026, c. 19, s. 101 (src:19440-19441)
GIVEN `the matter or proceeding is ongoing on the commencement day` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`2026 c 19 s 101 subsection 346(1.4) applies to the matter or proceeding` MEANS
    IF `the matter or proceeding is ongoing on the commencement day`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any matter or proceeding that is ongoing on the commencement day"


